    <id>http://arxiv.org/abs/2602.20607v1</id>
    <title>Functional central limit theorem for superdiffusive SDEs with stable noise</title>
    <updated>2026-02-24T07:00:27Z</updated>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2602.20607v1" rel="alternate" type="text/html"/>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/2602.20607v1" rel="related" type="application/pdf" title="pdf"/>
    <summary>This paper establishes a functional stable central limit theorem for a class of superdiffusive solutions to stochastic differential equations driven by an $α$-stable process.</summary>
